Subject: [PATCH 273/283] fix(execution): register repo-scope tool env reads
 from verify-0046-u4

Register the six PYPTO_X_* names that the verify-0046-u4 repo-scope scan
found read but unregistered in tools/ and scripts/ (AOCL_LIB,
AVX2_LAYOUT_SHA256_MANIFEST, DRIVER_PATH, LIBXSMM_LIB, VENDOR_EVIDENCE,
WORKTREE).  Reuse existing categories/enums, keep the registry schema at
v1 and fix the static scan scope to python/ + tools/ + scripts/ with a
repo-scope regex+AST guard test.  Doctor row set goes 40 -> 46; the
default plan/artifact/report digests are unchanged.

(cherry picked from commit 8cf9a1b4ee9bf2cf2e899fb01d427cd9f6b716d8)
